[
  {
    "line": 1,
    "text": "the sky finishes falling.",
    "start": 0.1,
    "end": 1.622
  },
  {
    "line": 2,
    "text": "Hi.",
    "start": 1.742,
    "end": 2.295
  },
  {
    "line": 3,
    "text": "You picked a volcano video.",
    "start": 2.415,
    "end": 4.111
  },
  {
    "line": 5,
    "text": "Historically speaking, Pompeii sits about eight kilometers from Vesuvius.",
    "start": 4.461,
    "end": 9.195
  },
  {
    "line": 6,
    "text": "Pompeii shrugs.",
    "start": 9.315,
    "end": 10.419
  },
  {
    "line": 8,
    "text": "Tony wanders into the street.",
    "start": 10.769,
    "end": 12.471
  },
  {
    "line": 9,
    "text": "Cart.",
    "start": 12.591,
    "end": 13.177
  },
  {
    "line": 11,
    "text": "Fucking cart.",
    "start": 13.297,
    "end": 14.227
  },
  {
    "line": 13,
    "text": "Pompeii had about three hundred sixteen stepping stones, with gaps for cart wheels.",
    "start": 14.577,
    "end": 19.698
  },
  {
    "line": 15,
    "text": "And because you chose to keep watching, the history gets even dumber.",
    "start": 20.048,
    "end": 24.044
  },
  {
    "line": 17,
    "text": "In the days before, small earthquakes were common there.",
    "start": 24.394,
    "end": 27.416
  },
  {
    "line": 18,
    "text": "Nobody took them as a warning.",
    "start": 27.536,
    "end": 29.33
  },
  {
    "line": 20,
    "text": "The mountain coughs, a small opening explosion.",
    "start": 29.68,
    "end": 32.725
  },
  {
    "line": 22,
    "text": "A shelf of jars hits Tony.",
    "start": 32.845,
    "end": 34.719
  },
  {
    "line": 23,
    "text": "Goddamn pottery.",
    "start": 34.839,
    "end": 36.083
  },
  {
    "line": 26,
    "text": "Wait a second.",
    "start": 36.433,
    "end": 37.358
  },
  {
    "line": 27,
    "text": "Tony actually found a genius way out.",
    "start": 37.478,
    "end": 39.613
  },
  {
    "line": 28,
    "text": "Hiding indoors!",
    "start": 39.733,
    "end": 40.869
  },
  {
    "line": 31,
    "text": "Wrong.",
    "start": 41.219,
    "end": 41.822
  },
  {
    "line": 32,
    "text": "Tony skipped history class again.",
    "start": 41.942,
    "end": 43.856
  },
  {
    "line": 33,
    "text": "Roofs, Tony.",
    "start": 43.976,
    "end": 44.948
  },
  {
    "line": 34,
    "text": "Think about the roofs.",
    "start": 45.068,
    "end": 46.251
  },
  {
    "line": 36,
    "text": "Nobody tells you.",
    "start": 46.601,
    "end": 47.716
  },
  {
    "line": 37,
    "text": "A few hours in, most roofs collapsed under about forty to sixty centimeters of pumice.",
    "start": 47.836,
    "end": 53.333
  },
  {
    "line": 39,
    "text": "Now the main eruption begins, around one o'clock.",
    "start": 53.683,
    "end": 56.913
  },
  {
    "line": 40,
    "text": "White pumice starts to fall.",
    "start": 57.033,
    "end": 58.584
  },
  {
    "line": 43,
    "text": "Light stones, up to about three centimeters wide, and every one finds Tony.",
    "start": 58.934,
    "end": 63.74
  },
  {
    "line": 44,
    "text": "Fuck.",
    "start": 63.86,
    "end": 64.472
  },
  {
    "line": 45,
    "text": "Heh heh heh.",
    "start": 64.592,
    "end": 65.594
  },
  {
    "line": 50,
    "text": "Pliny the Younger compared that cloud to an umbrella pine.",
    "start": 65.944,
    "end": 69.198
  },
  {
    "line": 52,
    "text": "Option A. Find a sloped roof.",
    "start": 69.548,
    "end": 71.393
  },
  {
    "line": 53,
    "text": "Option B. Wear a pillow helmet.",
    "start": 71.513,
    "end": 73.262
  },
  {
    "line": 55,
    "text": "Option C. Sell the stones.",
    "start": 73.612,
    "end": 75.198
  },
  {
    "line": 56,
    "text": "Trust me.",
    "start": 75.318,
    "end": 76.14
  },
  {
    "line": 58,
    "text": "Drop A, B, or C below before\u2014",
    "start": 76.49,
    "end": 78.735
  }
]
